WEBVTT

00:12.861 --> 00:14.988
I know where they are now.

00:16.531 --> 00:19.694
And Pairon has given me
an opportunity...

00:27.109 --> 00:28.872
...let's go, brother.

00:38.420 --> 00:41.878
Wherever we go,
there're soldiers everywhere.

00:42.157 --> 00:45.615
They've ramped up security
after all the trouble we caused.

00:45.994 --> 00:48.690
We've managed to get this far
without being detected...

00:48.764 --> 00:50.857
...but it'll be tough going in further.

00:51.733 --> 00:54.861
Why do
we have to hide, too?

00:55.837 --> 00:56.929
Now, now...

00:57.172 --> 00:59.265
Take it easy.

01:00.876 --> 01:04.437
What are those guys
planning to do?

01:30.372 --> 01:35.400
HEY YOU!
Shiraketa kao de nageite iru dake ja

01:36.478 --> 01:40.972
tabun nani mo hajimara nai
nige wa shinaide

01:41.917 --> 01:47.822
hashiri dashite iru mirai ga
aruno nara

01:48.256 --> 01:54.024
fukaku ochi konderu
hima wa nai

01:54.329 --> 02:00.427
hito wa sou daremo ga
toki to shite mayoi

02:00.502 --> 02:06.441
atae rareta hibi wo
tada ikite iru kedo

02:06.508 --> 02:12.674
ushinatte wa nara nai mono

02:12.748 --> 02:18.778
kakaete mamotte kizu tsuite

02:18.854 --> 02:25.020
sore demo mata aruki daseru

02:25.093 --> 02:31.430
chikara wo shinji teru yo

02:39.441 --> 02:42.477
The Trap of the Magnet Users
The Trap of the Magnet Users.

02:42.477 --> 02:46.208
The Trap of the Magnet Users

02:47.616 --> 02:48.708
Whatever the case...

02:48.784 --> 02:50.274
...if you want to
get to the Company...

02:50.352 --> 02:53.116
...you'll have to pass through
the plates.

02:53.688 --> 02:54.484
Plates?

02:55.991 --> 02:57.652
Another jargon?

02:58.393 --> 03:02.056
The plates are the concrete layers
designed to...

03:02.130 --> 03:05.429
...hide the Underground from
the people on the surface.

03:05.901 --> 03:07.664
The Underground may appear
like a web of...

03:07.736 --> 03:10.500
...endless corridors and passages...

03:10.572 --> 03:14.030
...but there are a few passages
that go between the various levels.

03:14.643 --> 03:17.111
And the passage through Tower Gate
is shut down.

03:17.612 --> 03:21.104
And I'm sure the other plate
passages have all been sealed as well.

03:21.283 --> 03:23.547
I'm sure they're well-guarded.

03:25.287 --> 03:27.016
What're you sitting around for?

03:27.689 --> 03:28.986
Are you an idiot?

03:29.324 --> 03:33.124
How do you think we got this far
without fighting anyone?

03:33.195 --> 03:34.753
What'd you just say!

03:34.996 --> 03:36.361
Think about it.

03:36.765 --> 03:39.632
The Company probably thinks...

03:39.701 --> 03:41.965
...we're still around Tower Gate.

03:42.270 --> 03:42.964
Hm?

03:43.738 --> 03:44.796
If it were me...

03:44.873 --> 03:48.969
...I'd focus on guarding
the plate passages in that area.

03:49.344 --> 03:50.311
I see.

03:50.512 --> 03:53.242
Because it's quite far
from Tower Gate.

03:53.315 --> 03:56.216
That's why we came
to the No. 5 Plate Passage.

03:56.351 --> 03:58.842
It takes us away
from the Company...

03:58.920 --> 04:01.286
...but I think it was
the best course of action to take.

04:01.690 --> 04:02.486
That's right.

04:02.891 --> 04:06.156
When you think about it, the
further we get from Tower Gate...

04:06.228 --> 04:06.661
...the fewer soldiers we'll likely run into.

04:06.661 --> 04:07.889
...the fewer soldiers we'll likely run into.
- Whatever.

04:08.163 --> 04:10.654
None of that's going to happen
after I beat her to a pulp!

04:10.966 --> 04:13.764
That's right, Chelsea Rorec!

04:13.835 --> 04:14.961
Gotcha!

04:16.571 --> 04:19.597
Why does stuff like this
only happen to me?!

04:26.148 --> 04:28.673
Did someone just
fall through here?

04:28.750 --> 04:29.682
Who knows?

04:30.452 --> 04:33.580
Anyway, as long as there's
no Class A warrior around...

04:33.655 --> 04:36.681
...it doesn't matter how many
of the little guys are around.

04:36.758 --> 04:39.693
Um, what's a Class A warrior?

04:40.262 --> 04:45.029
They're the elite forces
chosen among the best 100...

04:45.100 --> 04:47.330
...master warriors in the Company.

04:48.236 --> 04:51.262
I'll blow away
anyone who gets in the way.

04:51.706 --> 04:53.173
That's all we have to do!

04:54.509 --> 04:55.737
Simple-minded idiot!

04:56.645 --> 04:57.577
Let's get going.

04:57.646 --> 05:01.082
We're near one of the passages,
right?

05:22.304 --> 05:24.795
I thought there'd be soldiers
all over the place.

05:24.873 --> 05:26.101
But there's no one.

05:26.841 --> 05:27.637
That's strange.

05:28.076 --> 05:32.012
I chose a passage that I thought
wouldn't have much security...

05:32.080 --> 05:34.275
...but I can't believe there're
no soldiers at all.

05:34.616 --> 05:36.948
Well, it doesn't really matter
who shows up...

05:37.018 --> 05:39.543
...because I'm just going to
blow them away anyway.

05:41.089 --> 05:42.078
Hey!

05:42.157 --> 05:43.715
I've been wanting to tell you this...

05:43.792 --> 05:45.817
...but I wish you wouldn't just...

05:53.335 --> 05:54.267
Are you okay?!

05:54.703 --> 05:55.670
I've got you now!

05:55.737 --> 05:56.965
Company...!

05:57.305 --> 05:58.966
That one there is so cute.

05:59.040 --> 05:59.904
How much?

05:59.975 --> 06:01.704
I want one, too!

06:01.910 --> 06:03.502
I want those glasses.

06:03.778 --> 06:05.678
I'm giving them away!

06:05.747 --> 06:08.079
Feel free to take
whatever you want!

06:08.283 --> 06:10.376
Don't you know
how worried we were?!

06:10.452 --> 06:13.012
What the heck are you doing?!

06:13.255 --> 06:14.244
Huh?

06:14.522 --> 06:17.457
As you can see,
we're looking at some nice jewelry.

06:18.026 --> 06:20.221
Look at this, Miss Rorec!

06:20.295 --> 06:23.992
This man gave me this necklace!

06:24.266 --> 06:25.790
And I got these glasses.

06:26.635 --> 06:30.298
And you can choose something
for yourself as well.

06:30.372 --> 06:32.863
Oh, my! You're too generous!

06:33.375 --> 06:35.843
Miss Rorec, gimme your leg.

06:36.011 --> 06:37.342
Let's put on a ring.

06:38.513 --> 06:40.777
Oh, hey. What! Come on!

06:41.983 --> 06:44.543
I spent all last night
thinking up this...

06:44.619 --> 06:48.453
...perfect disguise and
this very natural situation.

06:48.657 --> 06:51.455
No one will be able to
tell who I am.

06:52.260 --> 06:53.352
Hey, you.

06:53.628 --> 06:56.096
You look really suspicious to me.

06:56.898 --> 06:58.092
He's running away!

07:00.902 --> 07:02.893
You think I'm going to run away?

07:04.339 --> 07:05.271
I-It's you!

07:05.674 --> 07:07.767
The magnetic power user
from that village!

07:08.109 --> 07:09.371
You're not getting away!

07:10.045 --> 07:12.343
You fool!
That's what I was about to say!

07:12.814 --> 07:15.374
Magnetic Power Adhesive!

07:18.787 --> 07:23.087
My jewelry has pinned me
to the wall and I can't move!

07:23.625 --> 07:24.956
What on earth...

07:25.026 --> 07:26.550
...is this all about?

07:27.028 --> 07:28.655
M-My glasses...

07:29.731 --> 07:32.700
Well, how does it feel to be
pinned up like that?

07:33.735 --> 07:38.172
Now that you're pinned up there,
I can do anything I want...

07:38.239 --> 07:41.231
...and you can't resist me!

07:43.645 --> 07:47.581
- What are you doing?!
- Here we go! There! There!

07:48.950 --> 07:49.848
Are you an idiot?

07:50.051 --> 07:53.452
Don't you realize that
I can still move?

07:55.256 --> 07:58.987
I am the only opponent
you're going to need!

08:01.663 --> 08:02.391
What?

08:06.234 --> 08:10.671
Is there someone else
lurking in the dark as well?

08:12.107 --> 08:16.043
Looks like I might be able to have
a little fun with you, Wind User.

08:18.079 --> 08:19.842
I've never seen this one before.

08:20.348 --> 08:21.975
Who is he?

08:22.484 --> 08:26.352
Sorry, but your friends will not
be able to escape.

08:26.554 --> 08:31.116
That jewelry was specially made,
combining both our powers.

08:31.626 --> 08:32.524
Both?

08:32.994 --> 08:35.554
Does that mean you're
also a magnetic power user?!

08:36.164 --> 08:37.290
I'm following orders.

08:37.899 --> 08:40.333
I have no personal grudge.

08:40.402 --> 08:41.664
But I'll have you disappear!

08:42.871 --> 08:44.463
Fine!

08:45.039 --> 08:48.475
Wow, so that wasn't a fluke
when you blocked it before.

08:49.878 --> 08:50.640
Then...

08:51.246 --> 08:53.077
I won't hold back either!

08:55.283 --> 08:56.443
Inline skates?

08:56.651 --> 08:57.242
He's fast!

08:57.919 --> 09:00.615
I use magnetic power
for acceleration!

09:00.688 --> 09:03.782
But that's not the only thing I can
do with my magnetic power!

09:03.992 --> 09:05.960
Spinning Yo-yo!

09:07.228 --> 09:08.695
The yo-yos repelled my sword!

09:08.930 --> 09:09.919
You fool!

09:09.998 --> 09:12.728
This time there's magnetic force
in the yo-yos!

09:13.368 --> 09:14.596
Hey, Wind User...

09:15.336 --> 09:17.736
I hope you don't disappoint me.

09:19.407 --> 09:20.465
Why, you!

09:21.276 --> 09:23.176
Spinning Tornado Attack!

09:28.516 --> 09:30.347
This kid's stronger than I expected.

09:31.853 --> 09:33.343
The little punk!

09:35.290 --> 09:36.450
But you know what?

09:36.524 --> 09:39.516
I can't afford to give up now.

09:40.261 --> 09:41.250
Hey, kid!

09:47.535 --> 09:49.332
The power of wind...!

09:50.305 --> 09:50.964
He's disappeared!

09:52.707 --> 09:53.867
Where are you looking?

09:55.710 --> 09:57.371
I'm right here!

09:59.180 --> 09:59.976
You did it!

10:00.882 --> 10:04.283
Sorry, but I don't have time
for child's play.

10:11.693 --> 10:14.628
Come on. Why can't we
have a little more fun?

10:18.566 --> 10:22.434
You fool. My little brother can do
a lot more than that.

10:23.505 --> 10:24.631
Little brother?

10:25.540 --> 10:27.440
Doesn't look like him at all.

10:27.509 --> 10:28.635
Not at all.

10:28.743 --> 10:33.237
How is it possible to have two
brothers that look so different?

10:33.948 --> 10:36.610
Actually, I thought
you'd left already.

10:36.885 --> 10:38.113
Leave me alone!

10:40.088 --> 10:43.148
Target.
Arrived at Level 1, Area 51.

10:43.358 --> 10:45.883
Contact has been made
by D-01 and D-02.

10:46.561 --> 10:47.653
Good.

10:48.763 --> 10:50.230
It's going as planned.

10:51.065 --> 10:53.056
I'll put it up on the screen.

11:03.478 --> 11:04.775
What's going on here?

11:05.213 --> 11:06.976
Even if Rumina held back
because he's a kid...

11:07.048 --> 11:09.039
...how could he be okay after
taking a direct hit from Rumina...

11:09.117 --> 11:11.551
...and be back up on his feet so quickly.

11:12.453 --> 11:15.616
He displaced the impact
by using magnetic repelling forces!

11:22.664 --> 11:24.131
Now you understand?

11:24.198 --> 11:25.756
With a steel sword like that...

11:25.833 --> 11:29.234
...there's no way you can inflict
a serious blow to me!

11:30.271 --> 11:31.238
Then...!

11:31.706 --> 11:34.231
Then I'll keep hitting you until
you grow weary!

11:34.642 --> 11:35.666
Simple-minded idiot.

11:35.977 --> 11:38.104
Well, it's just like him...

11:38.479 --> 11:40.447
But it's not a total waste.

11:40.548 --> 11:41.879
Even without a deadly blow...

11:41.950 --> 11:44.544
...the minor injuries will eventually
wear him down.

11:45.253 --> 11:48.745
I know I'm not going to be able to
deflect his attacks completely.

11:49.791 --> 11:50.587
Then...

11:50.992 --> 11:52.050
Big brother!

11:52.293 --> 11:53.021
Yeah!

11:53.628 --> 11:54.788
Big brother?!

11:55.263 --> 11:56.753
You guys are brothers?!

11:57.732 --> 11:59.165
You don't look anything alike!

11:59.233 --> 12:00.757
Just leave me alone, will ya?!

12:01.436 --> 12:03.870
We are true brothers.

12:04.806 --> 12:06.000
And this here is...

12:06.307 --> 12:08.002
...something only brothers can do!

12:08.076 --> 12:10.510
Fusion! Rising Yo-yo!

12:13.681 --> 12:14.511
Rumina!

12:17.452 --> 12:18.510
You...

12:19.053 --> 12:21.283
There're twice as many yo-yos!

12:21.356 --> 12:24.689
The yo-yos are moving faster
because they've combined powers.

12:26.060 --> 12:29.723
And it's not just speed,
the power has doubled.

12:30.665 --> 12:32.565
We'll get you in the end!

12:32.934 --> 12:35.368
With one of these eight
magnetic yo-yos.

12:36.137 --> 12:37.104
Then...

12:40.441 --> 12:41.373
He's reading the wind!

12:41.442 --> 12:43.171
That's right!
He had that up his sleeve!

12:43.378 --> 12:46.609
If he can read the wind caused by
the yo-yos flying around...

12:46.981 --> 12:48.676
...he'd be able to anticipate their path.

12:56.324 --> 12:59.452
I can't read the movements
of the yo-yos.

13:00.061 --> 13:02.359
But why?

13:02.897 --> 13:05.525
What's the matter?
You look kind of pale, Wind User!

13:05.767 --> 13:07.098
You're not so tough.

13:07.368 --> 13:09.768
Pairon himself gave me
orders to get rid of you...

13:09.837 --> 13:11.668
...so I thought you'd be something.

13:12.840 --> 13:13.829
Did you say Pairon?!

13:15.276 --> 13:20.213
Even though he managed
to dodge Teil Ashford...

13:20.281 --> 13:23.512
...he still is a surface dweller
with immature powers.

13:25.053 --> 13:27.214
Even the rebel bodyguard...

13:27.288 --> 13:30.018
...is probably weak from the
injuries she sustained in town.

13:32.060 --> 13:36.258
Given your abilities, I doubt this
will be a very difficult mission.

13:36.564 --> 13:37.223
Yes, sir!

13:37.732 --> 13:40.530
As a reward for successfully
completing this mission...

13:40.601 --> 13:44.435
...I will grant you the designation
of Class A warrior.

13:44.539 --> 13:49.499
You will become one of only eight
Class A warriors in the Company.

13:50.178 --> 13:52.669
Can you do it, Korin?

13:53.481 --> 13:56.575
Pairon, do you remember?

13:58.252 --> 14:00.584
I will never forget it.

14:00.655 --> 14:03.351
The day that you picked me up.

14:03.758 --> 14:06.556
And the words you spoke to me.

14:08.996 --> 14:11.521
If I am to repay you for my debt...

14:11.599 --> 14:14.261
...I'll be sure to succeed
in my mission.

14:14.802 --> 14:16.793
I'll stake my life on it!

14:17.672 --> 14:21.005
I have great expectations, Korin.

14:21.275 --> 14:21.832
Yes, sir!

14:25.079 --> 14:27.604
Damn! I knew that guy was
somehow involved in this!

14:32.019 --> 14:34.613
Why aren't you fighting
back?

14:34.989 --> 14:36.980
Compared to Teil's water daggers...

14:37.058 --> 14:39.856
...those yo-yos are
nothing but children's toys!

14:42.029 --> 14:45.692
What Blondie says is right.
This is the same kind of attack.

14:47.502 --> 14:49.265
But something's different.

14:50.872 --> 14:51.998
Sense of purpose!

14:52.673 --> 14:54.834
The water daggers
that Teil released...

14:54.909 --> 14:57.935
...were driven by a strong sense
that I was the enemy.

14:58.045 --> 15:00.946
And that made it easier
for me to read them.

15:01.215 --> 15:01.874
However...

15:02.316 --> 15:04.580
I don't feel that
with this kid's yo-yos.

15:04.952 --> 15:06.579
The patterns are totally random.

15:07.255 --> 15:08.415
In other words...

15:08.623 --> 15:11.751
...the random attacks are dependent on
magnetic repelling forces!

15:13.427 --> 15:14.325
Random...

15:15.963 --> 15:17.055
I get it!

15:22.136 --> 15:24.900
It's obvious now why I
couldn't read the wind!

15:26.374 --> 15:28.001
You totally had me fooled!

15:28.342 --> 15:32.642
You don't even know
how the yo-yos are moving!

15:33.548 --> 15:36.108
Damn! Korin!
Stop the yo-yos!

15:36.417 --> 15:41.013
I get it! Those two never had
complete control over the yo-yos!

15:41.389 --> 15:42.219
I see.

15:42.723 --> 15:43.655
Damn!

15:43.724 --> 15:45.157
Stay back! Get away from me!

15:45.526 --> 15:46.515
No way!

15:47.328 --> 15:48.158
Then...!

15:48.462 --> 15:49.656
How about this!

15:51.132 --> 15:52.531
Here's another!

15:56.437 --> 15:57.301
What?!

16:01.108 --> 16:02.075
Dodge it!

16:02.944 --> 16:05.071
Use my magnetic powers to block it!

16:10.985 --> 16:12.179
No way...

16:16.190 --> 16:20.058
Even your amazing magnetic
power couldn't deflect my fist.

16:22.363 --> 16:24.490
You'll be down for a while.

16:24.565 --> 16:26.726
I got you good right in the lower jaw.

16:27.869 --> 16:30.269
Get away from him, Korin!

16:30.538 --> 16:33.803
Who would've thought you cared
so much for your little brother.

16:33.875 --> 16:34.807
That voice...

16:40.014 --> 16:41.504
Maybe you were too focused
on fighting...

16:41.582 --> 16:45.177
...and forgot to keep the magnetic
power concentrated on the jewelry.

16:47.655 --> 16:48.383
Hold it.

16:49.590 --> 16:51.524
And you think you won?

16:52.894 --> 16:57.957
I'm going to become
a Class A warrior!

16:58.466 --> 17:01.697
He's making a last-ditch
suicide attack!

17:02.937 --> 17:06.134
His concentration is low because
his brother isn't helping.

17:07.775 --> 17:09.743
Right now, he's...

17:10.011 --> 17:11.273
Forget it.

17:16.951 --> 17:17.815
Oh, no...!

17:26.093 --> 17:27.082
I'm...

17:29.730 --> 17:30.992
A power user.

17:31.232 --> 17:33.723
Hey, I think this one's
a power user.

17:34.535 --> 17:38.471
Because I had a power, people
have shunned me all my life...

17:38.539 --> 17:40.063
...and treated me harshly.

17:42.176 --> 17:45.907
The only one who would
stick up for me was my brother...

17:45.980 --> 17:47.447
...who has the same power as me.

17:49.016 --> 17:52.850
And what got us out of the hell
I was living in was...

17:52.920 --> 17:54.615
...ironically, my power.

17:58.759 --> 18:00.056
You have good eyes.

18:01.228 --> 18:07.098
Your eyes are full of evil intent and
express rejection for everything.

18:09.770 --> 18:11.135
You want to come with me?

18:11.205 --> 18:14.197
You'd make a good master warrior.

18:14.909 --> 18:18.845
The double-edged sword, that was
my power, decided my fate.

18:18.913 --> 18:23.646
I chose to use my power
to rise up in the world.

18:25.519 --> 18:27.919
D-01 has gone silent.

18:28.823 --> 18:32.122
I suppose this was to be expected.

18:32.660 --> 18:35.720
Destroy the No. 5 passage.

18:36.097 --> 18:36.722
What?!

18:37.565 --> 18:41.001
But D-01 and D-02 are still there.

18:41.602 --> 18:44.469
And there seems to be a few of
our soldiers as well.

18:44.672 --> 18:45.866
Don't mind them.

18:46.073 --> 18:47.301
Just do it.

18:47.908 --> 18:48.704
But...

18:57.818 --> 18:58.682
You all right?

18:59.220 --> 18:59.811
Yeah.

19:00.154 --> 19:00.848
I guess.

19:01.655 --> 19:06.251
But we shouldn't feel guilty.
He passed out from his own power.

19:07.094 --> 19:09.028
I wonder if this kid's the same.

19:09.930 --> 19:12.125
Fooled by the Company.

19:12.433 --> 19:15.129
It's not the Company,
it's Pairon.

19:15.202 --> 19:19.002
I could just see him telling this kid
that he would be made...

19:19.073 --> 19:20.506
...a Class A warrior.

19:20.574 --> 19:22.804
The brothers got suckered in.

19:23.611 --> 19:26.671
They don't even have
any real ability.

19:26.847 --> 19:29.179
But I can't accept that either.

19:29.283 --> 19:31.581
Do you really think that...

19:31.652 --> 19:34.746
...Pairon thought he could stop
you two with them?

19:51.372 --> 19:52.999
That was horrible.

19:56.777 --> 19:58.768
I've found you!

20:32.646 --> 20:34.079
Wh-What is this?!

20:34.248 --> 20:36.546
Not again!

20:44.425 --> 20:49.226
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:49.296 --> 20:55.462
migakareru machi nami wo

20:55.536 --> 21:07.607
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:08.549 --> 21:19.392
